  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Experience the next generation of Pixel Poops, designed from the ground up for your NES! You've just learned that those ambitious, motivated joggers are out and about all over...from the park, to the middle of town, all the way to the graveyard! You've decided that it's your responsibility to stop them once again, armed with just your lightning-fast metabolism, and a fully-loaded gift card from the taco place! And this time, you can bring a friend along for two-player simultaneous play! That's right, the size of the poop-parazzi has doubled! Once again, small poops will only slow the joggers down. But keep pooping, and your poops will grow to massive size! Giant poops stop the joggers for good and score you points! When your chamber is empty, fill up at the taco place! And don't let too many joggers get away, or it's Game Over! Pixel Poops Number Two features fast action that only gets faster, a multitude of different environments and 50 challenging levels, gorgeous pixel art graphics and animation, and music and sound effects from CosmicGem and Shiru8Bit!"
    },
    {
      "langue": "de",
      "text": "Das Spiel verfügt über ein klassisches Arcade-Spiel mit zwei gleichzeitigen Spielern, bei dem die Spieler die Läufer (oder alles andere, was Ihnen im Weg steht) daran hindern, den Bildschirm zu überqueren, indem sie sie in großen Haufen Kacke fangen. Wenn sie ihre Kotzähler ausschöpfen lassen, müssen sie den Taco-Stand besuchen, um sie wieder zu füllen. Sie verliert fünf Läufer und das Spiel ist vorbei."
    },
    {
      "langue": "es",
      "text": "El juego cuenta con un clásico juego arcade de dos jugadores simultáneos en el que los jugadores evitan que los corredores (o cualquier otra cosa que se interponga en tu camino) crucen la pantalla atrapándolos en grandes montones de caca. Si dejan que sus medidores de caca se agoten, deberán visitar el puesto de tacos para volver a llenar. Pierde cinco corredores y se acabó el juego."
    }
  ],
